      "json": "OUTPUT FORMAT FOR THIS REQUEST: The user explicitly requests JSON. Return only a bare object with exactly eligible (boolean), reason (nonempty string) and nextStep (nonempty string). No fences or surrounding text. eligible is true only if all three standard conditions are explicit; otherwise false with uncertainty or the failed condition explained. Preserve all policy, privacy and capability constraints inside the strings."
